ts/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c" alt="" class="r-i487p9" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R36j2:"><div data-rid="05188ff5-3d3e-480c-b8e2-51e344965dff" class="r-hkb203"><div data-rid="b83341bc-9706-4a6a-85fc-cd0ddbff2135" class="r-mqzyv9"><div data-rid="59250784-75b4-44ac-9b26-0368540f2a80" class="r-1ntwc6u"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="c97e0d0d-bd39-4f61-a4bc-4268e223c5bb" class="r-yell7r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For women with natural or augmented breasts:</strong><br>Refer to your current band size and cup. Locate the combination on our size chart <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/size-guide"><u>here</u></a>. If you’re between sizes or unsure, we suggest purchasing more than one size and trying on in person to see what fits best. Unworn products can be returned (see our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/return-policy"><u>return policy</u></a> for more details).<br></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="b13eb516-f7ba-4a7d-a2b5-2261e05e2a39" class="r-fluxgk"><div data-rid="dbfbcfaa-9004-4a7d-9401-ab1c7ce114f9" class="r-vwa2rf"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="30183b4e-df51-4ddd-ad14-61fd8172dd7b" class="r-1tokg0f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For women who are post-mastectomy flat:</strong><br>If you’ve had a bilateral, double, or DMX mastectomy, refer to your former bra size both band and cup with an option to shift up or down <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/size-guide"><u>here</u></a> if you prefer to go smaller or larger.<br><br>If you’ve had a single-side or unilateral mastectomy, refer to your natural breast bra size band and cup and locate the corresponding breast form size <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/size-guide"><u>here</u></a>. Keep in mind you may need to try more than one size to find the best match.</p><br><p>You are welcome to try on at home to check sizing and return any unworn products (see our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/return-policy"><u>return policy</u></a> for more details).</p></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b9ddacce-3fc5-4fa3-abe7-0efc31694e49" class="r-1r68pa" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b94d85bf-fb2a-4cfd-8a76-ffc17bd9bf30" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R56j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-wquec1"><div data-rid="4820a6dd-c0af-4616-b716-cd1c3cf76e48" class="r-7qi6gi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>I don't know my bra size. Can you still help?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="6da08615-b396-450e-a960-df9e72378c6c" class="r-13vyo74"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-7r8098" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R56j2:"><div data-rid="05d79541-6d96-4e36-bbb8-eba9d9717b62" class="r-1hxq3gp"><div data-rid="25546a14-ee26-4d52-9440-85198f5fbb55" class="r-1j7hpks alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, we can try our best to help. Most importantly is knowing your band size. “C” cup can mean many different actual sizes in volume. For example 34C and 44C are very different sized “C” cups. You may need to try on more than one size to determine the best insert or form size.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f75259e4-9275-486c-8f31-f1ebb098e2a3" class="r-18p0fjl" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="03ff45df-3832-4f68-9969-680f187bdc7f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R76j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-15t6lo1"><div data-rid="d2351550-7ba0-48e8-9aa0-b6dabb952678" class="r-8tp3ns alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>My breasts are different sizes. What insert size should I order?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="60b37cb0-8cd7-4431-91a8-e7d9269f188a" class="r-rqxjr5"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-9g5acc" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R76j2:"><div data-rid="b0464eb4-27ab-4b39-9c02-22aed075acd9" class="r-1wz3gy7"><div data-rid="3d0c1cb0-1130-45c5-a0cc-47cca8de2b56" class="r-z84yc6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>You should order the insert size that will match the breast you’re looking to support. For example, if you are two different sizes, you may need to order two different sizes of inserts.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="72411959-1810-4cc2-8b11-5a0ddc88da50" class="r-j7myzr" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ebfb7f4b-ad58-47a7-bfb1-73a7ef0c0ba1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R96j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-15lckqc"><div data-rid="1e8a5138-1471-4545-98be-89f2ca95da28" class="r-jnf615 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What if I order the wrong size?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="4c3db2b4-552f-47ee-9271-8cc51cc18d4c" class="r-23f795"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-1p0ou3k" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R96j2:"><div data-rid="d2d0c9d6-d947-4fad-8351-ee09c1d12cca" class="r-k9tobd"><div data-rid="04bde8f1-2d82-4cfa-b712-85ee25482e50" class="r-y72y08 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every USA customer receives one complimentary size or style exchange per order.</p><br><p>We cover outbound shipping on the replacement for free. Customers cover return postage, which is typically $7.49 or just $1.98 with Checkout+ Protection. Additional exchanges beyond the first are not included and require a new order.</p><br><p>Exchanges can be made in our <a href="https://honey-cloudz.myshopify.com/apps/redo/returns-portal/login?referralId=693b2be113b2b1d7630ec189&_gl=1*1v51raf*_ga*MTExNzM3NzY0My4xNzgzMDgzMzkx*_ga_5RLSENL6QM*czE3ODQ5Mjg5NTQkbzM5JGcxJHQxNzg0OTI5NTc4JGo2MCRsMCRoMA.."><u>Returns & Exchanges Center</u></a> or if you need additional guidance please reach out to 800-607-1079, email us at <a href="mailto:support@honeycloudz.com"><u>support@honeycloudz.com</u></a>, or our website chat.</p><br><p>At this time, we do not offer International exchanges.</p><br><p>See our full return policy <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/return-policy"><u>here</u></a>.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1e5ab561-cc81-407c-961a-f4170ae19e64" class="r-p76un0"><div data-rid="a8e7efe0-951a-4521-80d0-1e7384810e30" class="r-109x83j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Materials & Features</p></span></div><div data-rid="6d4eca5a-c66e-4782-8375-eed998fbd738" class="r-1fxwqmh" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="f920cd3d-5cf1-4c99-b86a-e706e00093be" class="r-i8jxnx" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ada1d97e-0352-4868-9f63-4f84c22bfd1c" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R37j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1agp7ol r-1njvb5n"><div data-rid="d218ac27-8ae0-4c88-89e6-c67205f4bdce" class="r-1rw9h7r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What are Honey Cloudz made of?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="7134c76a-64df-4711-9121-e04ac02d7359" class="r-szezu4"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c" alt="" class="r-pk6q4f" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R37j2:"><div data-rid="3633e9ef-2b2a-423d-a4b5-8aac00864721" class="r-1lmgln3"><div data-rid="8b8ada50-4447-4f86-a388-ba360650b041" class="r-1awyy37 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">All of our breast forms and bra inserts are a hybrid blend of cloud-soft foam and our patented non-slip grippy-dot exterior design.</span></p><br><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Full details: 82% Polyester, 18% Spandex. 100% Polyurethane Foam. Patented Non-Slip Grippy Dot Exterior 100% Medical Grade Silicone. Latex-free.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="403a183d-0574-48ae-afd6-151c7b6a4754" class="r-h37809" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="0905930e-c175-4d0c-959a-3e3b4d949756" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R57j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-5lbziq"><div data-rid="67e7dac8-bbbf-4067-b930-e7c1c632274d" class="r-w7ybc1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are they lightweight?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="f931b968-b8d1-4a54-bf30-a912df3c5905" class="r-1cy2ur4"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-10l1le2" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R57j2:"><div data-rid="5de3c057-5bc2-434e-8d5b-a202bd5a7706" class="r-1p33asn"><div data-rid="c2b59c8d-c8ef-4edf-b86f-cd88f067744e" class="r-uqjofx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, both our bra inserts and breast forms are lightweight like cloudz :) You can view the weights of every product and size <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/size-guide"><u>here</u></a>.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b1ca1d90-d4b8-4a56-8184-8dd6dffc36bf" class="r-19lo0kz" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ca0ac787-34ad-4c9b-8947-6f34f1d12604" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R77j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-16ullct"><div data-rid="78fa359f-e776-4b4e-99d6-2289583ff715" class="r-cflev9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do Honey Cloudz slide around?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="ea3d2c90-a4df-4b50-b7e4-88edf7d2cad7" class="r-1juna0o"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-pu2efx" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R77j2:"><div data-rid="68cc18a8-4f68-4dc1-93bd-351063a826a1" class="r-lvs6yv"><div data-rid="cc93a50a-acdd-4114-a0d5-ad084aa3a0eb" class="r-1uvvzl5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>They’re designed to stay put! Our patented honeycomb silicone exterior grip design helps hold our bra inserts and breast forms in place by gripping against fabrics. For our breast forms specifically, they are engineered to stay-put within pockets for extra stability.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="24ef606c-6984-435d-9227-a1c0c87ba3e4" class="r-2fha8u" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="4cc74d54-7225-410d-874f-76a1b640c496" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R97j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-12c04k2"><div data-rid="0bb540bd-7768-4346-a2d2-841d14388b93" class="r-mpf69a alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are Honey Cloudz latex-free?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="23de2cef-2cdd-4901-b07a-527bc844ce57" class="r-i0kynp"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-11rnhrn" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R97j2:"><div data-rid="919db00f-03da-477a-a07c-49a192a08759" class="r-xroriq"><div data-rid="0d0c4650-d8d8-487a-800a-b52104063237" class="r-163iyi2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes! All of our products are latex-free.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="386ff874-ffd1-47ba-b2c2-53de5f9da403" class="r-1gkke0o" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="7562e5e8-118a-4f26-94bd-78aff83869d6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rb7j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-18rqhkp"><div data-rid="2b823561-e76c-4b60-b447-012523db61eb" class="r-rbvgnp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do they hold their shape?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="708c660e-a02a-4ac9-9719-de3aa45adc3b" class="r-w885ad"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-1xsj8e8" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rb7j2:"><div data-rid="900a38b7-07af-4dcd-bf9e-4f9b4f222987" class="r-ey71k4"><div data-rid="9f16515f-04fe-4073-9541-dae129003d49" class="r-qqj97c alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Yes, both our bra inserts and breast forms hold their shape well.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="5ebbb70d-ab84-4969-b2ad-d6924c651876" class="r-1hxeu9j" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="a65d1167-8fde-4783-9d51-9eec2c0f3b86" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rd7j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-a74vj3"><div data-rid="85ec9ffb-5032-4f68-9e32-a36e22613e55" class="r-1bci3m1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are they sold individually or in pairs?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="e7fa0543-df46-42aa-bdad-c61d3026cf30" class="r-1r3f7q7"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-19vg0r" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rd7j2:"><div data-rid="f6b89af8-fb61-4a45-93fd-6d9cacf2de90" class="r-1nty5wy"><div data-rid="4e1a94a3-c4c4-48d8-9c5b-367b179e03e5" class="r-fs6rqx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our breast forms (post-mastectomy) are sold individually in singles to help accommodate unilateral, single mastectomies.</p><br><p>Our bra inserts are sold in pairs.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6db6fc49-a5ba-4a41-ac9d-79048922b4d8" class="r-19rzzmv"><div data-rid="f9216f5c-dd44-4c3d-b86c-a7c83d055bec" class="r-ix0co2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Orders & Returns</p></span></div><div data-rid="6ae0a70d-e9bf-4944-bd01-358dbb1b7f44" class="r-1r30u8o" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="10117ea7-9e23-41e4-baf2-fb184297f4ca" class="r-1tll1gw" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="19b3d652-cbb3-4545-9128-05ca26049ab1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R38j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-11zelic r-95tr5e"><div data-rid="6c6af563-4875-40a3-8702-7ad4d920982a" class="r-ocgglz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How long do Honey Cloudz last?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="3ed3b24f-23f3-40cc-b08e-2f13874ccd24" class="r-iqcljh"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c" alt="" class="r-vtsagr" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R38j2:"><div data-rid="3a63f8c2-bb8d-4a1d-a447-62414b5ac5ab" class="r-svnidr"><div data-rid="cba92497-07a0-4fd6-b89e-bf05661461fd" class="r-d7qgdo alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>This can vary depending on multiple factors. Just like bras, it’s all about how often you wash them, how you care for them, and if you have a few that you alternate out versus wearing something everyday.  Everyone is different, however most women find our bra inserts and breast forms can last 6 months to a year. Eventually with time and natural wear, they will naturally lose their shape and hold as the foam breaks down over time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="138c8941-6821-4e3e-9acc-0830289bedfb" class="r-1kg6alv" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="907d6061-6d84-4d0e-a30f-df32bd3a95de" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R58j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-16l95bw"><div data-rid="cbac2416-8c09-441d-a8d2-8e7c4b0b3d0a" class="r-1gjywl4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is Checkout+ Protection?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="fb94d3e4-7832-4ff9-bc93-9d1027609815" class="r-1ketvyw"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-1qnx463" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R58j2:"><div data-rid="5b0ca789-60a8-4685-9cec-e76342b97304" class="r-1psx43z"><div data-rid="3cb1c833-4235-4c92-ab91-4a70f21508ab" class="r-7s4xd1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">With Checkout+ Protection, your return or exchange is reduced to just $1.98 instead of standard return postage costs.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="1798396c-bc26-4b17-9287-ea532a647467" class="r-1eq8l8a" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="cd8d652b-6ded-4979-b0a2-b28c87f964a9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R78j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ww034t"><div data-rid="fd9a4ef6-6922-4456-87a6-e53aa1bd65fa" class="r-1ftlzd4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's your exchange policy?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="4d493191-885a-4562-96b3-0ac247c5f469" class="r-1r8wyoh"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-4n06gg" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R78j2:"><div data-rid="804ec3a9-387e-484a-9a88-deba7500d71e" class="r-f6pqnd"><div data-rid="9026b905-321e-4673-9bb0-8014f60180a4" class="r-1a2znmh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Every USA customer receives one complimentary size or style exchange per order.</p><p><br></p><p>We cover outbound shipping on the replacement for free. Customers cover return postage, which is typically $7.95 or just $1.98 with Checkout+ Protection. Additional exchanges beyond the first are not included and require a new order.</p><p><br></p><p>Exchanges can be made in our <a href="https://honey-cloudz.myshopify.com/apps/redo/returns-portal/login?referralId=693b2be113b2b1d7630ec189&_gl=1*1v51raf*_ga*MTExNzM3NzY0My4xNzgzMDgzMzkx*_ga_5RLSENL6QM*czE3ODQ5Mjg5NTQkbzM5JGcxJHQxNzg0OTI5NTc4JGo2MCRsMCRoMA.."><u>Returns & Exchanges Center</u></a> or if you need additional guidance please reach out to 800-607-1079, email us at <a href="mailto:support@honeycloudz.com"><u>support@honeycloudz.com</u></a>, or our website chat.</p><p><br></p><p>At this time, we do not offer International exchanges.</p><p>See our full policy <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/return-policy"><u>here</u></a>.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2d7b557c-2a09-4e5a-bca1-d9a4b9c09336" class="r-10g7p6f" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="d697181b-ab06-4e07-8fb7-fe269920821a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R98j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-170qpxt"><div data-rid="acf5a9b3-7778-49d0-85a0-bedbff145845" class="r-18g880t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's your return policy?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="db25836f-5f8c-44d7-b76d-9d5058260cb6" class="r-19hfo1m"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-ohtfb9" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R98j2:"><div data-rid="ff5523f6-2549-4930-a652-77895be9d4c4" class="r-19d64k7"><div data-rid="2d047f76-e376-4177-89a4-44b3976f6f02" class="r-15hyire alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We gladly accept returns on new, unworn, and unwashed inserts and forms within 30 days of purchase for a refund or store credit.</p><br><p>Honey Cloudz products are hygiene-sensitive intimate items. For everyone’s safety, we can only accept returns that are unworn and unwashed.</p><br><p>Trying on for fit is absolutely fine—however, any visible signs of wear mean the item cannot be restocked or refunded.</p><br><p>See our full policy <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/return-policy"><u>here</u></a>.</p><p><br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="b4d4c52b-0b4b-48a0-a1e8-c3469a495ea6" class="r-10j06bn" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="91ae4ac4-3d76-4702-9b11-897e7090339c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rb8j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-b0bbj3"><div data-rid="88bdbd8f-9d71-4f05-90b5-bf383591ab3c" class="r-ginld5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Do you work with insurance?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="ff4194c1-c016-4464-be56-b19ac4eab586" class="r-18agjoy"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-oafgvd" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rb8j2:"><div data-rid="23021da9-72db-48b0-9a34-525c6c8b710b" class="r-1dn6lrk"><div data-rid="ca7a30d4-6215-46e7-9a57-629bd70fe733" class="r-1u67lqr alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Many insurance plans do cover breast prostheses through approved medical suppliers. We chose a different path.</p><br><p>By selling directly to women, we're able to offer high-quality breast forms for $29–$49 each, helping make them accessible whether someone has insurance, has a high deductible, doesn't qualify for coverage, or simply wants an affordable option without the paperwork.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="83f2fefc-880e-4ccb-9487-15b7203709d4" class="r-1f1vxjk" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="18104625-fbaf-48eb-b9f4-9d6860473d49" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rd8j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-3feo1a"><div data-rid="97359f44-c69c-40a2-ad24-f438dbcc2ad3" class="r-80v2b5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Can I use my HSA or FSA?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="80a7dea8-1e2e-415c-9cc6-568e73b4e661" class="r-11621lj"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-lk7faq" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rd8j2:"><div data-rid="c8db3606-a47a-4bbd-bdbd-420048d6f1d4" class="r-yri4ap"><div data-rid="71bd241b-3766-4eef-a97e-f5cdc0beafab" class="r-b00ge0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>At this time we are not connected to HSA and networks.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div